Cell["Numerical comparison with energy integrals", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"555f4837-156c-415a-9ca0-48e90d578592"],

Cell["\<\
Evaluate the following loading cell, then the input cells of each example in \
order. Both numerical calculations are included: QLiB is evaluated as \
multiple polylogarithms, and the displayed rational function is integrated \
directly over all auxiliary energies. Keep QLiB.m and NumPolyLog.m beside \
this notebook.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"98e64c18-7cad-4af1-9df5-1924feeef3fa"],

