Cell["\<\
The internal energies are fixed. The direct integrands include the product of \
2Y over the internal edges; no loop-momentum integration is performed. The \
two methods are evaluated independently, without changing either overall sign.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9e2cf6bc-4ac1-466f-8aac-539c6cfa5cce"],

